-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",415,{
[13249]="70052B1F\n1\tFind and defeat Drokstaz the Undying in Avabárg\tDrokstaz the Undying can be found somewhere in the depths of Avabárg. Desperate to avenge her husband, Fara has begged you to defeat the terrible warg known as Drokstaz the Undying.\n2\tTalk to Fara\tFara can be found in Hultvís. You have slain Drokstaz the Undying and should now return to Fara.\n",
[13250]="7005A959\n1\tSearch the corpse for additional information\tThe dead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should search the corpse for additional information as to the Angmarim's presence here.\n2\tBurn Angmarim corpses at Khorroz (total: 4)\tDead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should burn the Angmarim corpses at Khorroz.\n3\tInvestigate the voices heard in Khorroz\tVoices can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should investigate the voices heard in Khorroz.\n4\tInvestigate the voices heard in Khorroz\tVoices can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should investigate the voices heard in Khorroz.\n5\tDefeat Iron Crown Sentinels and destroy the evidence (total: 2)\tIron Crown Sentinels can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should defeat the Iron Crown Sentinels and destroy any evidence of your deeds.\n6\tTalk to Lóssi\030Talk to Prince Ingór\tPrince Ingór can be found at Maergrind and Lóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu. You should talk to Prince Ingór or Lóssi.\n",
[13251]="700698A7\n1\tTest the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master\tThe first door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master in the Upper Ward.\n2\tTest the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, in the yard of an enclosed estate\tThe second door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, within the walls of an enclosed estate in the Upper Ward.\n3\tTest the lock on the door to the palatial manor north-east of Dâr Laja\tThe third door to test is to the north-east of Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, and is the entrance to a palatial manor within the Upper Ward.\n4\tTalk to Yamin in the Grand Market of the Upper Ward\tYamin is at the Grand Market in the Upper Ward.\n5\tCollect rocks with shiny flakes from Bâlakhat (total: 8)\030Collect crocodile teeth (total: 6)\tRocks with shiny flakes and crocodiles with sharp teeth can be found near Bâlakhat, outside the city and along the south-eastern shore.\n6\tBring the rocks and crocodile teeth to Kîflu at the Shoreward Stone\tKîflu can be found at the Shoreward Stone, waiting to accept delivery of the items you collected for Yamin.\n7\tYou hear approaching footsteps\tYou hear approaching footsteps.\n8\tTalk to Khôltekh at the Shoreward Stone\tKhôltekh nods to you in greeting, summoning you to speak with him outside the Shoreward Stone.\n9\tTalk to Yamin by the Grand Market in the Upper Ward\tYamin is at the Grand Market in the Upper Ward.\n",
[13252]="70061384\n1\tFind Reginard's camp-site in the marsh\tThe hobbit Reginard has gone missing. You might find clues to his whereabouts at his camp-site in the marsh west of Tighfield.\n2\tExamine the footprints\tYou have found Reginard's camp-site, but not him. You should examine the footprints at the camp-site.\n3\tFind Reginard at Lhúngobel\tGoblins may have captured Reginard and taken him to Lhúngobel. You should try to find him there.\n4\tTalk to Reginard\tThe goblins have held Reginard captive in Lhúngobel. You should talk to him.\n",
[13253]="700413C2\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Dead at Dâr Matum (total: 6)\030Defeat Orcs at Dâr Matum (total: 2)\030Defeat Ruthless Dead captain\tRuthless Dead and Orcs can be found in the mountain pass encampment in the north-western part of Ringló Vale. Defeat Ruthless Dead and Orcs in Dâr Matum.\n2\tSpeak with Arvaethor\tArvaethor can be found near a mountain pass encampment in the north-western part of Ringló Vale. You should speak with Arvaethor.\n",
[13254]="7002F748\n1\tMount the unruly steed and ride until it calms down\tThe unruly horse is waiting at the Elthengels stable in the Norcrofts. The stable-hand, Adnoth, has asked you to take the unruly horse for a ride, in the hopes that it might relax and slowly become more amenable to handling.\n2\tReturn to Adnoth and talk to him about your discovery\tElthengels' stable-hand, Adnoth, is awaiting your return at the stables near the south-west entrance to Elthengels. The unruly steed led you to discover the body of its former owner. It has since become calmer, and the stablemaster must be informed of this development.\n",
[13255]="700571AB\n1\tTalk to Vaskorn in Limlók\tVaskorn can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Vaskorn.\n2\tPatrol the wilds near the White Mare\tVaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók. You should patrol the wilds near the White Mare.\n3\tPatrol the wilds north of the White Mare\tVaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók. You should patrol the wilds north of the White Mare.\n4\tPatrol the wilds west of the river\tVaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók. You should patrol the wilds west of the river.\n5\tTalk to Vaskorn\tVaskorn can be found in the north wilds of the Floodfells. You should talk to Vaskorn.\n6\tTalk to Vaskorn at Limlók\tVaskorn can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Vaskorn.\n7\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.\n",
[13256]="700351C0\n1\tExamine remains of Baleful Wood-trolls (total: 8)\tWood-trolls and Huorns can be found to the south, east, and west of Stonecliff. Tithenolf wants you to defeat corrupted Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood and examine their remains in hopes of understanding what has driven them to such aggression.\n2\tTalk to Tithenolf\tTithenolf can be found in northern Balewood at Stonecliff near the path to the Limlight Gorge. You should return to Tithenolf with news of the unnatural chill surrounding the Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood.\n",
[13257]="70027303\n1\tFind a set of footprints on the western shore of the lake, north-west of the eyot\030Find a set of footprints beneath the rocky cliffs west of the western shore\030Collect avanc-jaws (total: 5)\tThere may be footprints on the far side of the lake, and there certainly are avanc. Wynfor wants you to look for footprints on the far side of the lake in Tâl Methedras. He also wants you to slay avanc and bring him their jaws.\n2\tBring avanc-jaws to Wynfor\tWynfor is at Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras. You have scouted the far shore of the lake for footprints and have also collected the jaws of the avanc that live there. You should bring them to Wynfor as he requested.\n",
[13258]="7005AAFB\n1\tDefeat Nargákh the Unyielding\030Defeat Ufmazat the Overwhelming\tThe leaders of the Orc and hobgoblin armies battle each other in Thyrstáth. You should defeat Nargákh the Unyielding and Ufmazat the Overwhelming.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tUse the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[13259]="70058C8B\n1\tDefeat Orcs and the Trench-captain at Ushkútoz\tThe Ushkútoz Trenches can be found underneath the scorched ruins of Zudramdân. You should defeat Orcs and the Ushkútoz Trench-captain at Ushkútoz.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at Ushkútoz (total: 10)\030Defeat the Ushkútoz Trench-captain\tThe Ushkútoz Trenches can be found underneath the scorched ruins of Zudramdân. You should defeat Orcs and the Ushkútoz Trench-captain at Ushkútoz.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs at Ushkútoz.\n",
[13260]="70066876\n1\tDeliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Alagrant\030Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Tingobel\030Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Sardol\030Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Lancrath\tAlagrant can be found to the south of Morlad, Tingobel can be found to the east of Morlad, Sardol can be found far to the south-west of Morlad near Tarlang's Crown, and Lancrath can be found far to the south-east of Morlad near Tarlang's Neck, in the Blackroot Vale. Malthellam has asked you to deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of the Blackroot Vale. You should travel to the hamlets of Alagrant, Tingobel, Sardol, and Lancrath.\n2\tTalk to Malthellam in Morlad\tMalthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.\n",
[13261]="7000075B\n1\tFind and speak with Grimbriar's scouts\tThe brigand-encampment is at the southern end of the Vale of Andrath, south down the Greenway, far beyond the Greenway Crossing. Grimbriar's men, Watchers Brittleaf and Oakdale, will be hidden somewhere nearby. Watcher Grimbriar has learned that Sharkey's Men and their half-orc allies have blockaded the Vale of Andrath. He has asked you to travel south to support his men.\n",
[13262]="7004B2E2\n1\tAttempt to open Locked Doors (total: 6)\tLocked doors can be found in many places in the valley of Udûn. You should attempt to open these doors and defeat whatever creatures lurk inside.\n",
[13263]="700088CB\n1\tDeliver the tokens of valour to Quartermaster Ash\030Collect tokens of valour (total: 25)\tQuartermaster Ash is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Ash sent you to earn tokens of valour by assisting members of the Free Peoples.\n",
[13264]="70008363\n1\tBring the trophies to Othran\030Collect swamp-fly wings (total: 5)\030Collect Swamp-lurker legs (total: 5)\tSwamp-lurkers and swamp-flies can be found throughout the swamp near the hunters' camp. Othran has asked you to collect Swamp-lurker legs and swamp-fly wings, which his people use to their benefit.\n",
[13265]="70068347\n1\tSpeak with the engraver Dorshet\030Speak with the cook Zerkho\030Speak with the outfitter Karbah\tTevurin asked that you visit the three expert assistants to learn about the crocodiles and other creatures that make the beaches of the Cape of Umbar their home. When you have learned what the experts know, you are to return to Tevurin so that he can provide you further direction.\n2\tTalk to Tevurin\tYou spoke with the visiting specialists from Umbar Baharbêl. Return to Tevurin and tell her that you are prepared for her requests.\n",
[13266]="70036C2C\n1\tDestroy White-hand Totems or Defilers carrying totems ([see journal]/18)\tThe enemy has brought totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. They must be stopped before they are able to cause destruction to all upon the wall. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[13267]="700381C7\n1\tDefeat Orc Totem-callers (total: 9)\030Defeat the Orc Defiler, Dagrí\tThe Orc defiler Dagrí has brought his totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. He must be stopped before he is able to cause destruction to all upon the wall and defeated before he can flee from the battlefield. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[13268]="7004541C\n1\tEnter the Variag blockade\030Find a suitable place in the blockade to cause a distraction\tThe Variag blockade can be found in northern Taur Drúadan, near the western end of Maudhúl Grak. You should find a place in the Variag blockade where many Varigas are grouped.\n2\tDance in front of or Mock to distract a large group of Variags\tThe Variag blockade can be found in northern Taur Drúadan. You should find and distract a large group of Variags at their blockade.\n3\tShake fist at or Challenge to distract a large group of Variags\tThe Variag blockade can be found in northern Taur Drúadan. You should find and distract a large group of Variags at their blockade.\n4\tStand your ground and distract the Variags\tThe Variag blockade can be found in northern Taur Drúadan. You should stand your ground at the Variag blockade. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tSpeak with Herefara\tHerefara can be found in the War-stead of the Helmingas. You should speak with Herefara.\n",
[13269]="700032D9\n1\tSearch north of Wilimar Bolger's home\tThe arrow came from the area near the hedge-gate that leads to the Bridgefields, north of Wilimar Bolger's home. Wilimar Bolger has asked you to search the place where he thinks the arrow came from, in hopes of finding some sign of the person who loosed it and what it might mean.\n2\tBring the journal to Wilimar Bolger\030Collect journal\tWilimar Bolger can be found near his hole on the north-west side of Budgeford. In the area Wilimar Bolger asked you to search, you found an abandoned camp-site and a journal. Perhaps this journal will contain some information helpful to Wilimar. You should take it back to him.\n",
[13270]="70007806\n1\tDefeat Blackwold thieves (total: 3)\030Defeat Vance Waithman\tHimloc Grouse's pipe-weed field is on the hill above Eldo Swatmidge's home, east of Staddle. Himloc is sure the Blackwold brigands will keep stealing from his pipe-weed crop unless you can defeat them as they try. Himloc thinks that you can handle these thieves by yourself and advised that you look for them in his field, but be wary of the leader.\n2\tTalk to Himloc Grouse in Staddle\tHimloc Grouse is in the town square of Staddle. Himloc will be pleased to hear that you have prevented the Blackwolds from stealing more of his pipe-weed.\n",
[13271]="700005B0\n1\tTalk to Farmer Maggot\tBamfurlong, Maggot's farm, is south along the river road, in the Marish. Mat Harfoot has asked you to look for Violet Underhill and suggested you speak first with old Farmer Maggot.\n",
[13272]="70017526\n1\tDefeat crawlers (total: 50)\tCrawlers can be found in the Sixteenth Hall, north-east of the Shadowed Refuge. Ymar seems to be affected differently than all the others who keep watch at the Shadowed Refuge. He is haunted by visions of crawlers, and wishes you kill them while you are in the Sixteenth Hall.\n2\tReturn to Ymar at the Shadowed Refuge\tYmar is at the Shadowed Refuge, south-west of the Sixteenth Hall. You have slain many, many vile crawlers and should inform Ymar that the nightmarish threat has passed.\n",
[13273]="70030DA7\n1\tDefeat Bile-draugar in Byrgenstow\t\n2\tDefeat Bile-draugar in Byrgenstow (total: 5)\tBile-draugar may be found in the depths of Byrgenstow. You should cleanse Byrgenstow of the Bile-draugar.\n",
[13274]="70027F1C\n1\tUse the bucket to throw water on the flaming tree\tAs Lhan Tarren burns, the river still flows with quelling water astride the village. The flames are beginning to spread.... You should search the banks of the river for a way to carry water to the fires, starting with the nearest fire at the tree by the bridge.\n2\tUse the bucket to douse the fire at the Elder's hut\tAnother fire burns at the Elder's hut. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town. You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut where the Elder once stood.\n3\tThrow water on the fire at the hut in the middle of town\tAnother fire burns in the middle of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town. You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut in the middle of the village.\n4\tThrow water on the fire at the north-east edge of town\tAnother fire burns at the north-east corner of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town. You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut at the north-east edge of the village.\n5\tReturn to Guto\tGuto can be found in Lhan Tarren, mourning the loss of his grandfather the Elder. You should return to Guto in Lhan Tarren.\n",
[13275]="70019D42\n1\tTalk to Glasnír at the Vineyards of Lórien\tThe vintner Glasnír is outside the Vineyards of Lórien, south-east of Caras Galadhon. Bruicheron has asked you to retrieve a special vintage of wine from the vintner and to bring it to her beloved Belvagor, with the request that he join her for a relaxing day.\n2\tBring the wine to Belvagor at the entrance to Caras Galadhon\tBelvagor is guarding the gates of Caras Galadhon. Glasnír has given you the special vintage of wine requested by Bruicheron, and now you should deliver it to Belvagor.\n3\tBring the special vintage to Bruicheron\tBruicheron is on Telain Glorelloth, in Caras Galadhon. Belvagor has decided his duty requires him to remain on guard against the Orcs for the moment, and he regretfully cannot yet join Bruicheron for a day of relaxation. You should return to Bruicheron with the tidings.\n",
[13276]="70054655\n1\tDestroy spider totems (total: 10)\tLegolas has asked you to destroy spider totems in Cadar Skûs, for fear they may be conduits for foul magic.\n2\tTalk to Legolas\tYou have destroyed many spider totems in Cadar Skûs. You should talk to Legolas.\n",
[13277]="700017DB\n1\tAsk Idhremmin what he hears in the Fields of Fornost\tIdhremmin is at Mincham's Camp in the North Downs, at the south-west edge of the Fields of Fornost. You should ask Idhremmin what he hears.\n2\tMeditate to listen for any strange sounds\tIdhremmin is at Mincham's Camp in the North Downs, at the south-west edge of the Fields of Fornost. You should meditate and listen for signs of whatever has held Idhremmin's attention for so long. NOTE: This quest requires emotes. Type the '/meditate' command and hit enter.\n3\tMeditate to listen for any strange sounds\tIdhremmin is at Mincham's Camp in the North Downs, at the south-west edge of the Fields of Fornost. You should wait and listen for signs of whatever has held Idhremmin's attention for so long.\n4\tTell Idhremmin that you heard the chilling voice in the air\tIdhremmin is at Mincham's Camp in the North Downs, at the south-west edge of the Fields of Fornost. You should consult with Idhremmin about what you heard.\n5\tFind the source of the unsettling song\tThe song came from the north-west of Mincham's Camp, in the Fields of Fornost. You should search for the source of the strange song.\n6\tReturn to Idhremmin\tIdhremmin can be found at Mincham's Camp on the edge of the Fields of Fornost. You should return to Idhremmin at Mincham's Camp.\n",
[13278]="7003E452\n1\tPoke a Fangorn sapling\030Cough at a Fangorn tree\030Hug an enormous tree\tThe trees Quickbeam's Huorn wishes to find can be found to the south-east of Derndingle. Quickbeam's Huorn has expressed a desire to speak to the trees near his home, south of Derndingle.\n2\tTalk to Quickbeam's Huorn\tYou have attempted to speak to each of the trees to which Quickbeam's Huorn directed you.\n",
[13279]="70044313\n1\tSpeak with Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall at Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n2\tSpeak with Ceveneth\tCeveneth is in the hall at Crithost. You should speak with Ceveneth.\n3\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the North-gate. You should return to Ingold and speak with him about your adventures in Talath Anor.\n",
[13280]="7006EBE5\n1\tSecure the first waggon\030Secure the second waggon\030Secure the third waggon\030Secure the fourth waggon\030Defeat Ekhamâti soldiers (total: 10)\tYour mission is to intercept a caravan of waggons filled with supplies and weapons, defeat and soldiers guarding it, and turn over the caravan to Mizâdi's forces.\n2\tDefeat the Ekhamâti Dôlo\tThe Ekhamâti Dôlo has arrived to defend the caravan. Find and defeat him.\n",
})
